  "title": "Chef John&#39;s Macaroni and Cheese",
  "description": "This panko mac and cheese is Chef John&#39;s easy-to-make, old-fashioned casserole with a crisp, buttery breadcrumb topping and a gooey, cheesy center.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2011-10-12T12:47:38-04:00",
